ent to the course team.\":\"Share what worked well or what could be clearer. Your feedback is only sent to the course team.\",\"Lesson feedback\":\"Lesson feedback\",\"The examples made the lesson easy to understand.\":\"The examples made the lesson easy to understand.\",\"Sending\u2026\":\"Sending\u2026\",\"Update feedback\":\"Update feedback\",\"Send feedback\":\"Send feedback\",\"Watch a short video about how this course can help you.\":\"Watch a short video about how this course can help you.\",\"StockNow Learning\":\"StockNow Learning\",\"Learn to trade with a plan and fewer mistakes\":\"Learn to trade with a plan and fewer mistakes\",\"Charts, fundamentals, scanners, risk control, and real market practice together.\":\"Charts, fundamentals, scanners, risk control, and real market practice together.\",\"{value} classes\":\"{value} classes\",\"Lifetime access\":\"Lifetime access\",\"Review support\":\"Review support\",\"Enroll Now\":\"Enroll Now\",\"Start learning today\":\"Start learning today\",\"Enroll once to unlock the complete learning system.\":\"Enroll once to unlock the complete learning system.\",\"Learn step by step why to buy, where to set a stop-loss, when to wait, and which mistakes to avoid, instead of trading only on signals.\":\"Learn step by step why to buy, where to set a stop-loss, when to wait, and which mistakes to avoid, instead of trading only on signals.\",\"Entry\":\"Entry\",\"Decide after understanding the setup\":\"Decide after understanding the setup\",\"Risk\":\"Risk\",\"Plan to protect your capital\":\"Plan to protect your capital\",\"Review\":\"Review\",\"Support to identify mistakes\":\"Support to identify mistakes\",\"Build your skills to make better decisions\":\"Build your skills to make better decisions\",\"Get the full course, checklists, templates, reviews, community, and future updates.\":\"Get the full course, checklists, templates, reviews, community, and future updates.\",\"Enroll now\":\"Enroll now\",\"Available Previe