ative will contact you with course details.\":\"Enter your name and mobile number. Our representative will contact you with course details.\",\"Suitable for beginners\":\"Suitable for beginners\",\"Chart and scanner training\":\"Chart and scanner training\",\"Risk management\":\"Risk management\",\"Your name\":\"Your name\",\"Mobile number\":\"Mobile number\",\"01XXXXXXXXX\":\"01XXXXXXXXX\",\"We have received your information\":\"We have received your information\",\"Learn to make decisions through analysis\":\"Learn to make decisions through analysis\",\"Follow a structured path from market basics to company analysis, chart reading, stock selection, entry and exit planning, and capital management.\":\"Follow a structured path from market basics to company analysis, chart reading, stock selection, entry and exit planning, and capital management.\",\"Course fee\":\"Course fee\",\"\u09f315,000\":\"\u09f315,000\",\"One fee for the complete course and all benefits\":\"One fee for the complete course and all benefits\",\"What you will learn and receive\":\"What you will learn and receive\",\"A structured learning path from basics to advanced topics\":\"A structured learning path from basics to advanced topics\",\"Assignment reviews, private community, and lifetime updates\":\"Assignment reviews, private community, and lifetime updates\",\"Our representative will contact you after enrollment as well\":\"Our representative will contact you after enrollment as well\",\"Please try again in a little while.\":\"Please try again in a little while.\",\"Features:\":\"Features:\",\"BDT\":\"BDT\",\"/month\":\"/month\",\"Buy Now\":\"Buy Now\",\"Tk\":\"Tk\",\"for\":\"for\",\"month\":\"month\",\"Password Reset\":\"Password Reset\",\"Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Quo, molestiae suscipit? Ullam doloribus possimus aut. Est quidem maiores modi, odit harum, quam delectus distinctio debitis, et atque earum vero amet. Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipis