e leading financial markets app in Bangladesh, we offer comprehensive stock market information through our website, Android, and iPhone platforms, ensuring you stay informed and empowered, wherever you are.\":\"Welcome to StockNow, the premier platform for real-time financial data, charts, and in-depth analysis of the Dhaka Stock Exchange. As the leading financial markets app in Bangladesh, we offer comprehensive stock market information through our website, Android, and iPhone platforms, ensuring you stay informed and empowered, wherever you are.\",\"StockNow was founded by Aminul Islam Selim, well-known as Selim Aminul, a visionary in financial technology with a passion for democratizing access to stock market information. Selim Aminul\\'s expertise and commitment to innovation drive our platform\u2019s success and continuous evolution.\":\"StockNow was founded by Aminul Islam Selim, well-known as Selim Aminul, a visionary in financial technology with a passion for democratizing access to stock market information. Selim Aminul\\'s expertise and commitment to innovation drive our platform\u2019s success and continuous evolution.\",\"Our Mission\":\"Our Mission\",\"At StockNow, our mission is to provide investors with cutting-edge tools and insights to make smart financial decisions. We combine the latest news, real-time data, and expert analysis into a user-friendly platform designed to meet the needs of both seasoned investors and those just starting out.\":\"At StockNow, our mission is to provide investors with cutting-edge tools and insights to make smart financial decisions. We combine the latest news, real-time data, and expert analysis into a user-friendly platform designed to meet the needs of both seasoned investors and those just starting out.\",\"Our team is dedicated to delivering the best possible experience for our users, and we\\'re constantly working to improve our app and add new features to help you stay ahead of the curve. We believe that everyone deserves access to the tools and resources they need to make smart financial decisions, and we\\'re committed to delivering a comprehensive, user-friendly solution for our users.\":\"Our team is dedicated to delivering the best possible experience for our users, and we\\'re constantly working to improve our app and add new features to help you stay ahead of the curve. We believe that everyone deserves access to the tools and resources they need to make smart financial decisions, and we\\'re committed to delivering a comprehensive, user-friendly solution for our users.\",\"With StockNow, you can easily analyze and understand the stock market and make informed investment decisions promptly. Thank you for choosing StockNow, and we look forward to helping you achieve your investment goals!\":\"With StockNow, you can easily analyze and understand the stock market and make informed investment decisions promptly. Thank you for choosing StockNow, and we look forward to helping you achieve your investment goals!\",\"StockNow\\'s main objective is to gain awareness among investors in Bangladesh.\":\"StockNow\\'s main objective is to gain awareness among investors in Bangladesh.\",\"StockNow uses charts powered by TradingView. A trading and investing platform providing cutting edge analytical tools like\":\"StockNow uses charts powered by TradingView. A trading and investing platform providing cutting edge analytical tools like\",\"Screener\":\"Screener\",\"and\":\"and\",\"Economic Calendar\":\"Economic Calendar\",\"StockNow offers two types of services; Basic free services and VIP-Membership services.\":\"StockNow offers two types of services; Basic free services and VIP-Membership services.\",\"Basic free services:\":\"Basic free services:\",\"Share price\":\"Share price\",\"Trade information\":\"Trade information\",\"Fundamental information\":\"Fundamental information\",\"Manage Portfolio\":\"Manage Portfolio\",\"Minute Chart, 1 year basic Chart\":\"Minute Chart, 1 year basic Chart\",\"Multiple favorite list\":\"Multiple favorite list\",\"Block Trade\":\"Block Trade\",\"Spot share, Halt share\":\"Spot share, Halt share\",\"Technical chart\":\"Technical chart\",\"Upcoming Events\":\"Upcoming Events\",\"VIP-Membership services:\":\"VIP-Membership services:\",\"Use apps without advertisement\":\"Use apps without advertisement\",\"Unlimited Price alarm\":\"Unlimited Price alarm\",\"Fundamental History\":\"Fundamental History\",\"Unlimited chart History\":\"Unlimited chart History\",\"Advance technical analysis with customizable UI\":\"Advance technical analysis with customizable UI\",\"Access of all upcoming VIP features\":\"Access of all upcoming VIP features\",\"VIP priority service\":\"VIP priority service\",\"StockNow strives to be a one-stop-analysis for traders and investors with apps available on iOS and Android, which has been the highest rated financial markets app on Google Play Store.\":\"StockNow strives to be a one-stop-analysis for traders and investors with apps available on iOS and Android, which has been the highest rated financial markets app on Google Play Store.\",\"StockNow,\":\"StockNow,\",\"34, H.M. Plaza(10th Floor),\":\"34, H.M. Plaza(10th Floor),\",\"Suit #2B, Road #02, Sector #03,\":\"Suit #2B, Road #02, Sector #03,\",\"Uttara, Dhaka- 1230\":\"Uttara, Dhaka- 1230\",\"Trade License No: 339367\":\"Trade License No: 339367\",\"Delivery time of our packages/products are almost instant. However in some cases it may take up to 3 working days.\":\"Delivery time of our packages/products are almost instant. However in some cases it may take up to 3 working days.\",\"Helpful videos / Tutorials:\":\"Helpful videos / Tutorials:\",\"DSEX\":\"DSEX\",\"DSES\":\"DSES\",\"DS30\":\"DS30\",\"About Us\":\"About Us\",\"Terms and Conditions\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"Refund and Return Policy\":\"Refund and Return Policy\",\"Privacy Policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"The information is provided by StockNow in its website and while it en