 Is Being Prepared\",\"Thank you for purchasing early. Your enrollment is confirmed, and your full access is reserved.\":\"Thank you for purchasing early. Your enrollment is confirmed, and your full access is reserved.\",\"We are finalizing the complete lesson flow, examples, and practice structure so you get a high-quality learning experience from day one. Instead of publishing unfinished modules, we are preparing everything properly for a smooth step-by-step release.\":\"We are finalizing the complete lesson flow, examples, and practice structure so you get a high-quality learning experience from day one. Instead of publishing unfinished modules, we are preparing everything properly for a smooth step-by-step release.\",\"You will automatically see the full course here as soon as publishing is complete. No extra payment is needed.\":\"You will automatically see the full course here as soon as publishing is complete. No extra payment is needed.\",\"Expected full availability by {value}.\":\"Expected full availability by {value}.\",\"Practice what you learned so far. This lesson unlocks {value}.\":\"Practice what you learned so far. This lesson unlocks {value}.\",\"Content hidden for privacy\":\"Content hidden for privacy\",\"{value} completed\":\"{value} completed\",\"Step {value} of {value2}\":\"Step {value} of {value2}\",\"{value} remaining\":\"{value} remaining\",\"Complete this lesson to unlock the next one.\":\"Complete this lesson to unlock the next one.\",\"Practice what you learned so far.\":\"Practice what you learned so far.\",\"Your next video unlocks {value}. Come back {value2}.\":\"Your next video unlocks {value}. Come back {value2}.\",\"Prev\":\"Prev\",\"Next\":\"Next\",\"{value} / {value2} completed \u2022 {value3} lessons \u2022 Enrolled\":\"{value} / {value2} completed \u2022 {value3} lessons \u2022 Enrolled\",\"Module {value}: {value2}\":\"Module {value}: {value2}\",\"Open course lessons\":\"Open course lessons\",\"Close lesson picker\":\"Close les