 about how this course can help you.\",\"StockNow Learning\":\"StockNow Learning\",\"Learn to trade with a plan and fewer mistakes\":\"Learn to trade with a plan and fewer mistakes\",\"Charts, fundamentals, scanners, risk control, and real market practice together.\":\"Charts, fundamentals, scanners, risk control, and real market practice together.\",\"{value} classes\":\"{value} classes\",\"Lifetime access\":\"Lifetime access\",\"Review support\":\"Review support\",\"Enroll Now\":\"Enroll Now\",\"Start learning today\":\"Start learning today\",\"Enroll once to unlock the complete learning system.\":\"Enroll once to unlock the complete learning system.\",\"Learn step by step why to buy, where to set a stop-loss, when to wait, and which mistakes to avoid, instead of trading only on signals.\":\"Learn step by step why to buy, where to set a stop-loss, when to wait, and which mistakes to avoid, instead of trading only on signals.\",\"Entry\":\"Entry\",\"Decide after understanding the setup\":\"Decide after understanding the setup\",\"Risk\":\"Risk\",\"Plan to protect your capital\":\"Plan to protect your capital\",\"Review\":\"Review\",\"Support to identify mistakes\":\"Support to identify mistakes\",\"Build your skills to make better decisions\":\"Build your skills to make better decisions\",\"Get the full course, checklists, templates, reviews, community, and future updates.\":\"Get the full course, checklists, templates, reviews, community, and future updates.\",\"Enroll now\":\"Enroll now\",\"Available Preview Videos\":\"Available Preview Videos\",\"Watch these free previews before checkout\":\"Watch these free previews before checkout\",\"This feature is available to VIP members. Tap the button below to become a VIP member.\":\"This feature is available to VIP members. Tap the button below to become a VIP member.\",\"VIP\":\"VIP\",\"Shares\":\"Shares\",\"Advertisement\":\"Advertisement\",\"No results found\":\"No results found\",\"User Menu\":\"User Menu\",\"Portf