droid, and iPhone platforms, ensuring you stay informed and empowered, wherever you are.\",\"StockNow was founded by Aminul Islam Selim, well-known as Selim Aminul, a visionary in financial technology with a passion for democratizing access to stock market information. Selim Aminul\\'s expertise and commitment to innovation drive our platform\u2019s success and continuous evolution.\":\"StockNow was founded by Aminul Islam Selim, well-known as Selim Aminul, a visionary in financial technology with a passion for democratizing access to stock market information. Selim Aminul\\'s expertise and commitment to innovation drive our platform\u2019s success and continuous evolution.\",\"Our Mission\":\"Our Mission\",\"At StockNow, our mission is to provide investors with cutting-edge tools and insights to make smart financial decisions. We combine the latest news, real-time data, and expert analysis into a user-friendly platform designed to meet the needs of both seasoned investors and those just starting out.\":\"At StockNow, our mission is to provide investors with cutting-edge tools and insights to make smart financial decisions. We combine the latest news, real-time data, and expert analysis into a user-friendly platform designed to meet the needs of both seasoned investors and those just starting out.\",\"Our team is dedicated to delivering the best possible experience for our users, and we\\'re constantly working to improve our app and add new features to help you stay ahead of the curve. We believe that everyone deserves access to the tools and resources they need to make smart financial decisions, and we\\'re committed to delivering a comprehensive, user-friendly solution for our users.\":\"Our team is dedicated to delivering the best possible experience for our users, and we\\'re constantly working to improve our app and add new features to help you stay ahead of the curve. We believe that everyone deserves access to the tools and resources they need to make smart financial decisions, and we\\'re committed to delivering a comprehensive, user-friendly solution for our users.\",\"With StockNow, you can easily analyze and understand the stock market and make informed investment decisions promptly. Thank you for choosing StockNow, and we look forward to helping you achieve your investment goals!\":\"With StockNow, you can easily analyze and understand the stock market and make informed investment decisions promptly. Thank you for choosing StockNow, and we look forward to helping you achieve your investment goals!\",\"StockNow\\'s main objective is to gain awareness among investors in Bangladesh.\":\"StockNow\\'s main objective is to gain awareness among investors in Bangladesh.\",\"StockNow uses charts powered by TradingView. A trading and investing platform providing cutting edge analytical tools like\":\"StockNow uses charts powered by TradingView. A trading and investing platform providing cutting edge analytical tools like\",\"Screener\":\"Screener\",\"and\":\"and\",\"Economic Calendar\":\"Economic Calendar\",\"StockNow offers two types of services; Basic free services and VIP-Membership services.\":\"StockNow offers two types of services; Basic free services and VIP-Membership services.\",\"Basic free services:\":\"Basic free services:\",\"Share price\":\"Share price\",\"Trade information\":\"Trade information\",\"Fundamental information\":\"Fundamental information\",\"Manage Portfolio\":\"Manage Portfolio\",\"Minute Chart, 1 year basic Chart\":\"Minute Chart, 1 year basic Chart\",\"Multiple favorite list\":\"Multiple favorite list\",\"Block Trade\":\"Block Trade\",\"Spot share, Halt share\":\"Spot share, Halt share\",\"Technical chart\":\"Technical chart\",\"Upcoming Events\":\"Upcoming Events\",\"VIP-Membership services:\":\"VIP-Membership services:\",\"Use apps without advertisement\":\"Use apps without advertisement\",\"Unlimited Price alarm\":\"Unlimited Price alarm\",\"Fundamental History\":\"Fundamental History\",\"Unlimited chart History\":\"Unlimited chart History\",\"Advance technical analysis with customizable UI\":\"Advance technical analysis with customizable UI\",\"Access of all upcoming VIP features\":\"Access of all upcoming VIP features\",\"VIP priority service\":\"VIP priority service\",\"StockNow strives to be a one-stop-analysis for traders and investors with apps available on iOS and Android, which has been the highest rated financial markets app on Google Play Store.\":\"StockNow strives to be a one-stop-analysis for traders and investors with apps available on iOS and Android, which has been the highest rated financial markets app on Google Play Store.\",\"StockNow,\":\"StockNow,\",\"34, H.M. Plaza(10th Floor),\":\"34, H.M. Plaza(10th Floor),\",\"Suit #2B, Road #02, Sector #03,\":\"Suit #2B, Road #02, Sector #03,\",\"Uttara, Dhaka- 1230\":\"Uttara, Dhaka- 1230\",\"Trade License No: 339367\":\"Trade License No: 339367\",\"Delivery time of our packages/products are almost instant. However in some cases it may take up to 3 working days.\":\"Delivery time of our packages/products are almost instant. However in some cases it may take up to 3 working days.\",\"Helpful videos / Tutorials:\":\"Helpful videos / Tutorials:\",\"DSEX\":\"DSEX\",\"DSES\":\"DSES\",\"DS30\":\"DS30\",\"About Us\":\"About Us\",\"Terms and Conditions\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"Refund and Return Policy\":\"Refund and Return Policy\",\"Privacy Policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"The information is provided by StockNow in its website and while it endeavours to keep the information up to date and correct, it makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, suitability or availability with respect to the website or the information, products, services or related graphics contained in the website for any purpose. Any opinions expressed in this website are only those of the source and neither StockNow nor Dhaka Stock Exchange Limited (or any other party) shall be responsible for any information or imputation contained therein.\":\"The information is provided by StockNow in its website and while it endeavours to keep the information up to date and correct, it makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, suitability or availability with respect to the website or the information, products, services or related graphics contained in the website for any purpose. Any opinions expressed in this website are only those of the source and neither StockNow nor Dhaka Stock Exchange Limited (or any other party) shall be responsible for any information or imputation contained therein.\",\"Lorem ipsum dolor, sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Architecto exercitationem sit provident soluta ullam, ad et non. Unde voluptas fuga totam repudiandae. Iusto laborum dignissimos ex unde nulla quis itaque.\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor, sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Architecto exercitationem sit provident soluta ullam, ad et non. Unde voluptas fuga totam repudiandae. Iusto laborum dignissimos ex unde nulla quis itaque.\",\"General\":\"General\",\"StockNow (\u201cthe Company\u201d or \u201cStockNow\u201d or \u201cwe\u201d) is the owner of the website stocknow.com.bd (\u201cthe Website\u201d) and the StockNow mobile application (\u201cthe App\u201d; collectively and separately known as \u201cthe Service\u201d). StockNow is committed to protecting your privacy and we understand you want to keep your information private, safe and discrete. This Privacy Policy is designed to help you decide whether to use the Service and in what manner, and it describes how we collect, store and use information on individuals who use the Service.\":\"StockNow (\u201cthe Company\u201d or \u201cStockNow\u201d or \u201cwe\u201d) is the owner of the website stocknow.com.bd (\u201cthe Website\u201d) and the StockNow mobile application (\u201cthe App\u201d; collectively and separately known as \u201cthe Service\u201d). StockNow is committed to protecting your privacy and we understand you want to keep your information private, safe and discrete. This Privacy Policy is designed to help you decide whether to use the Service and in what manner, and it describes how we collect, store and use information on individuals who use the Service.\",\"The Services hereunder are offered by StockNow, registered at:\":\"The Services hereunder are offered by StockNow, registered at:\",\"Room #03, Road #02, Sector #03,\":\"Room #03, Road #02, Sector #03,\",\"Consent to use Information\":\"Consent to use Information\",\"This Policy is a legally binding agreement between you (\u201cyou\u201d or \u201cuser\u201d) and us. By visiting, accessing or using the Website or App, or providing information to us in any other format, you agree to and accept the terms of this Privacy Policy, as amended from time to time, and you consent to the collection and use of information in the manner set out in this Policy. We encourage you to review this Policy carefully and to periodically refer to it so that you understand it and its subsequent changes if any. IF YOU DO NOT AGREE TO THE TERMS OF THIS PRIVACY POLICY, PLEASE STOP USING THE SERVICE IMMEDIATELY AND WHERE RELEVANT UNINSTALL.\":\"This Policy is a legally binding agreement between you (\u201cyou\u201d or \u201cuser\u201d) and us. By visiting, accessing or using the Website or App, or providing information to us in any other format, you agree to and accept the terms of this Privacy Policy, as amended from time to time, and you consent to the collection and use of information in the manner set out in this Policy. We encourage you to review this Policy carefully and to periodically refer to it so that you understand it and its subsequent changes if any. IF YOU DO NOT AGREE TO THE TERMS OF THIS PRIVACY POLICY, PLEASE STOP USING THE SERVICE IMMEDIATELY AND WHERE RELEVANT UNINSTALL.\",\"The definitions in the Terms and Conditions apply to this Privacy Policy unless stated otherwise. IN ADDITION TO THIS POLICY, PLEASE REVIEW OUR TERMS AND CONDITIONS WHICH IS INCORPORATED HEREIN BY REFERENCE, TOGETHER WITH SUCH OTHER POLICIES OF WHICH YOU MAY BE NOTIFIED OF BY US FROM TIME TO TIME.\":\"The definitions in the Terms and Conditions apply to this Privacy Policy unless stated otherwise. IN ADDITION TO THIS POLICY, PLEASE REVIEW OUR TERMS AND CONDITIONS WHICH IS INCORPORATED HEREIN BY REFERENCE, TOGETHER WITH SUCH OTHER POLICIES OF WHICH YOU MAY BE NOTIFIED OF BY US FROM TIME TO TIME.\",\"What Information Do We Collect?\":\"What Information Do We Collect?\",\"We collect two types of data and information from you:\":\"We collect two types of data and information from you:\",\"(1) Non-Personal Information \u2013 We retain some non-personally identifiable information (\u201cNon-Personal Information\u201d), such as your approximate geo-location, your web request, browser type, browser language, web pages you visit before or after visiting our Website or using the App, URLs, platform type, click numbers, landing pages, viewed pages and the order of those pages and time spent on pages. This information is collected and retained for security reasons and so that we can audit and statistically track usage, audit our affiliates, and calculate payments to third parties.\":\"(1) Non-Personal Information \u2013 We retain some non-personally identifiable information (\u201cNon-Personal Information\u201d), such as your approximate geo-location, your web request, browser type, browser language, web pages you visit before or after visiting our Website or using the App, URLs, platform type, click numbers, landing pages, viewed pages and the order of those pages and time spent on pages. This information is collected and retained for security reasons and so that we can audit and statistically track usage, audit our affiliates, and calculate payments to third parties.\",\"\u201cCookies\u201d - Non-Personal Information is collected, inter alia, through the use of cookies, so when accessing or using the Website, we may use one or more cookies. Cookies are small text files, placed on a user\\'s device, which enable a website to remember user preferences. Detailed information about cookies and how we use them on the Website and other websites implementing our web tools may be found in our cookies policy, which also describes how you can turn off cookies or control them.\":\"\u201cCookies\u201d - Non-Personal Information is collected, inter alia, through the use of cookies, so when accessing or using the Website, we may use one or more cookies. Cookies are small text files, placed on a user\\'s device, which enable a website to remember user preferences. Detailed information about cookies and how we use them on the Website and other websites implementing our web tools may be found in our cookies policy, which also describes how you can turn off cookies or control them.\",\"Web Beacons - We also use a software technology called \u201cclear gifs\u201d (also known as Web Beacons). Web Beacons are small pieces of code placed on a website to monitor the behavior and collect data about the visitors viewing a web page. For example, web beacons can be used to count the users who visit a web page or to deliver a \u201ccookie\u201d to the browser of a visitor viewing that page.\":\"Web Beacons - We also use a software technology called \u201cclear gifs\u201d (also known as Web Beacons). Web Beacons are small pieces of code placed on a website to monitor the behavior and collect data about the visitors viewing a web page. For example, web beacons can be used to count the users who visit a web page or to deliver a \u201ccookie\u201d to the browser of a visitor viewing that page.\",\"(2) Personal Information - \u201cPersonal Information\u201d is information that may be of a private or sensitive nature, including your name, gender, phone number, e-mail address or mailing address, payment information and IP address. We collect your IP address as part of your use of the Service. We also collect the following Personal Information from you when you create an account (\u201cAccount\u201d) on the Website which is required to access certain parts of the Service: your full name, email address, password, and phone number.\":\"(2) Personal Information - \u201cPersonal Information\u201d is information that may be of a private or sensitive nature, including your name, gender, phone number, e-mail address or mailing address, payment information and IP address. We collect your IP address as part of your use of the Service. We also collect the following Personal Information from you when you create an account (\u201cAccount\u201d) on the Website which is required to access certain parts of the Service: your full name, email address, password, and phone number.\",\"You are not required to provide us with this information in order to use the service. If you choose to provide us with this information, we will retain it in our records and process it only in accordance with the provisions of this Privacy Policy.\":\"You are not required to provide us with this information in order to use the service. If you choose to provide us with this information, we will retain it in our records and process it only in accordance with the provisions of this Privacy Policy.\",\"As an alternative, you are also able to create an Account using your credentials with a designated third party website or service such as Facebook, Google+ or Twitter (\u201cThird Party Account\u201d). Doing so will enable you to login to your Account via your Third Party Account. If you choose this option, a Third Party Account pop-up box will appear at the time of creating your Account which you will need to approve in order to proceed with the Account opening, and which will describe the types of information that we will obtain from and the types of activities that we may perform in connection with your Third Party Account. Such information may include (but not be limited to) your Personal Information stored on this Third Party Account, such as your user name, email address, profile picture, gender, date of birth and any other information which you have chosen to make profile on such Third Party Account. Please note that once your Account has been opened, the Personal Information we have access to via a Third Party Account is also dependent on your individual privacy settings in such Third Party Account and any privacy policies which are maintained by the providers of such Third Party Accounts.\":\"As an alternative, you are also able to create an Account using your credentials with a designated third party website or service such as Facebook, Google+ or Twitter (\u201cThird Party Account\u201d). Doing so will enable you to login to your Account via your Third Party Account. If you choose this option, a Third Party Account pop-up box will appear at the time of creating your Account which you will need to approve in order to proceed with the Account opening, and which will describe the types of information that we will obtain from and the types of activities that we may perform in connection with your Third Party Account. Such information may include (but not be limited to) your Personal Information stored on this Third Party Account, such as your user name, email address, profile picture, gender, date of birth and any other information which you have chosen to make profile on such Third Party Account. Please note that once your Account has been opened, the Personal Information we have access to via a Third Party Account is also dependent on your individual privacy settings in such Third Party Account and any privacy policies which are maintained by the providers of such Third Party Accounts.\",\"We treat any Non-Personal Information which is specifically connected or linked to any Personal Information as Personal Information.\":\"We treat any Non-Personal Information which is specifically connected or linked to any Personal Information as Personal Information.\",\"We collect and process the Personal Information referred to above based, where applicable, on your consent, where the processing is necessary for the performance of a contract between you and the Company or where the processing is necessary for the purpose of fulfilling a legitimate interest pursued by us.\":\"We collect and process the Personal Information referred to above based, where applicable, on your consent, where the processing is necessary for the performance of a contract between you and the Company or where the processing is necessary for the purpose of fulfilling a legitimate interest pursued by us.\",\"What is the Purpose of Collecting this Information?\":\"What is the Purpose of Collecting this Information?\",\"In order to access our services, users may be asked to fill in a form, providing some personal information to the Company. Answers to questions on Personal Information are not mandatory unless the fields are marked with an asterisk. Provision of the information requested in the optional fields of the registration form is not mandatory in order to receive the services and information that we provide through the Site (unless otherwise indicated in the registration form). However, failure to complete mandatory fields or providing incorrect Personal Information may prevent us from fully providing the requested information or services. Please note that you are under no legal obligation to provide us with your Personal Information, however you may not be able to enjoy our services or access the Site if you fail to do so.\":\"In order to access our services, users may be asked to fill in a form, providing some personal information to the Company. Answers to questions on Personal Information are not mandatory unless the fields are marked with an asterisk. Provision of the information requested in the optional fields of the registration form is not mandatory in order to receive the services and information that we provide through the Site (unless otherwise indicated in the registration form). However, failure to complete mandatory fields or providing incorrect Personal Information may prevent us from fully providing the requested information or services. Please note that you are under no legal obligation to provide us with your Personal Information, however you may not be able to enjoy our services or access the Site if you fail to do so.\",\"The collection and processing of Personal Information is aimed at providing you with the Service (including setting up your account), to send you marketing offers on products or services we think may be relevant to you, and to fulfill other purposes as provided in this privacy policy.\":\"The collection and processing of Personal Information is aimed at providing you with the Service (including setting up your account), to send you marketing offers on products or services we think may be relevant to you, and to fulfill other purposes as provided in this privacy policy.\",\"Non-Personal Information is collected for research and statistical purposes, to enable us to develop, customize and improve the Service, based on your preferences, usage and interactions with the Service, to process your requests for information, and to provide you with the most relevant services and offers.\":\"Non-Personal Information is collected for research and statistical purposes, to enable us to develop, customize and improve the Service, based on your preferences, usage and interactions with the Service, to process your requests for information, and to provide you with the most relevant services and offers.\",\"We use cookies in conjunction with third parties to collect user information. Your Personal Information is collected to enable us to provide you with features, capabilities, offers and marketing materials we or our marketing partners think you may be interested in.\":\"We use cookies in conjunction with third parties to collect user information. Your Personal Information is collected to enable us to provide you with features, capabilities, offers and marketing materials we or our marketing partners think you may be interested in.\",\"In addition to the above, your Personal Information allows us to provide you with technical assistance and support.\":\"In addition to the above, your Personal Information allows us to provide you with technical assistance and support.\",\"Who Else Receives this Information?\":\"Who Else Receives this Information?\",\"We may share or transfer information, including Personal Information, internally within our group of companies, for the purposes outlined above. These companies may be located in countries that may provide a different level of protection of privacy than in your jurisdiction.\":\"We may share or transfer information, including Personal Information, internally within our group of companies, for the purposes outlined above. These companies may be located in countries that may provide a different level of protection of privacy than in your jurisdiction.\",\"We also share Personal and Non-Personal Information with trusted third parties, when this is required in order to provide, maintain or improve our services and operation. This is the case with third party advertisements and affiliates; we share your information with third parties for the purpose of providing you with advertisements and offers we or third parties think you may be interested in. These third parties may be located in countries that may provide a different level of protection of privacy than in your jurisdiction.\":\"We also share Personal and Non-Personal Information with trusted third parties, when this is required in order to provide, maintain or improve our services and operation. This is the case with third party advertisements and affiliates; we share your information with third parties for the purpose of providing you with advertisements and offers we or third parties think you may be interested in. These third parties may be located in countries that may provide a different level of protection of privacy than in your jurisdiction.\",\"We share your Personal and Non-Personal Information with (i) third parties which provide services to the Company in order to allow or enable us to provide you with our Service, including analytics, email services providers and data verifiers; (ii) third parties who provide the Company services in relation to the operation of the Website; (iii) any auditors, contractors or other advisers auditing any of the Company\u2019s business processes; and (iv) any potential purchasers or investors in the Company.\":\"We share your Personal and Non-Personal Information with (i) third parties which provide services to the Company in order to allow or enable us to provide you with our Service, including analytics, email services providers and data verifiers; (ii) third parties who provide the Company services in relation to the operation of the Website; (iii) any auditors, contractors or other advisers auditing any of the Company\u2019s business processes; and (iv) any potential purchasers or investors in the Company.\",\"If you choose to open a member card, other users of the Website may be able to view the following personal information about you (to the extent that you have provided it to us): your name, picture and general geographic location (country).\":\"If you choose to open a member card, other users of the Website may be able to view the following personal information about you (to the extent that you have provided it to us): your name, picture and general geographic location (country).\",\"If you have chosen to share Personal Information with us through one of our forms, we may share it with any or all of our third party providers, which may provide you with a loan offer. Please note that this third party may be considered a \u201ccontroller\u201d of your Personal Information and the processing of such Personal Information will be subject to such provider\\'s privacy policy.\":\"If you have chosen to share Personal Information with us through one of our forms, we may share it with any or all of our third party providers, which may provide you with a loan offer. Please note that this third party may be considered a \u201ccontroller\u201d of your Personal Information and the processing of such Personal Information will be subject to such provider\\'s privacy policy.\",\"Any processing performed by any of our third party service providers (\u201cRecipients\u201d) will, where required by law, be governed by a data processing agreement in the form required by law, preserving any and all of your statutory data protection rights and obligating the Recipients to respect the Personal Information and handle it in accordance with the relevant laws. If a Recipient is located outside the EEA, we will transfer your data only to such countries as approved by the European Commission as providing adequate level of data protection, or ensure that the legal agreements governing the data transfer provide an adequate level of data protection. The Recipients are required to maintain the confidentiality of such information and to use your Personal Information only in the course of providing the aforementioned services and only for the purposes that StockNow dictates.\":\"Any processing performed by any of our third party service providers (\u201cRecipients\u201d) will, where required by law, be governed by a data processing agreement in the form required by law, preserving any and all of your statutory data protection rights and obligating the Recipients to respect the Personal Information and handle it in accordance with the relevant laws. If a Recipient is located outside the EEA, we will transfer your data only to such countries as approved by the European Commission as providing adequate level of data protection, or ensure that the legal agreements governing the data transfer provide an adequate level of data protection. The Recipients are required to maintain the confidentiality of such information and to use your Personal Information only in the course of providing the aforementioned services and only for the purposes that StockNow dictates.\",\"We may also share your Personal Information and other information in special cases if we have a good reason to believe that it is necessary to: (i) comply with law, regulation, subpoena, request by an applicable authority or court order; (ii) detect, prevent or otherwise address fraud, security, violation of our policies or technical issues; (iii) enforce the provisions of this Privacy Policy or any other agreements between you and StockNow, including investigation of potential violations thereof; or (iv) protect against harm to the rights, property or safety of the Company, its partners, its affiliates, users or the public.\":\"We may also share your Personal Information and other information in special cases if we have a good reason to believe that it is necessary to: (i) comply with law, regulation, subpoena, request by an applicable authority or court order; (ii) detect, prevent or otherwise address fraud, security, violation of our policies or technical issues; (iii) enforce the provisions of this Privacy Policy or any other agreements between you and StockNow, including investigation of potential violations thereof; or (iv) protect against harm to the rights, property or safety of the Company, its partners, its affiliates, users or the public.\",\"Advertisements\":\"Advertisements\",\"We may use a third-party advertising technology to serve advertisements when you access the Site. This technology uses your information with regards to your use of the Services to serve advertisements to you (e.g., by placing third-party cookies on your web browser).\":\"We may use a third-party advertising technology to serve advertisements when you access the Site. This technology uses your information with regards to your use of the Services to serve advertisements to you (e.g., by placing third-party cookies on your web browser).\",\"You may opt-out of many third-party ad networks, including those operated by members of the Network Advertising Initiative (\u201cNAI\u201d) and the Digital Advertising Alliance (\u201cDAA\u201d).\":\"You may opt-out of many third-party ad networks, including those operated by members of the Network Advertising Initiative (\u201cNAI\u201d) and the Digital Advertising Alliance (\u201cDAA\u201d).\",\"Direct Marketing\":\"Direct Marketing\",\"We may share your full name, email address and phone number with certain broker(s) (the \u201cBroker\u201d) in the event that you have granted permission to receive promotional materials from such Broker at the time of registration. The Broker may periodically use your full name, email address and phone number for the purpose of providing you with promotional materials if your permission was granted at the time of registration and you have not unsubscribed at a later time in accordance with the provisions hereof.\":\"We may share your full name, email address and phone number with certain broker(s) (the \u201cBroker\u201d) in the event that you have granted permission to receive promotional materials from such Broker at the time of registration. The Broker may periodically use your full name, email address and phone number for the purpose of providing you with promotional materials if your permission was granted at the time of registration and you have not unsubscribed at a later time in accordance with the provisions hereof.\",\"User Rights and Retention\":\"User Rights and Retention\",\"You have the right to access, correct, update or object to the use of your Personal Information by making a written request to StockNow by using our Contact Us page. Your requests will be dealt with in a prompt and professional manner and in accordance with applicable law.\":\"You have the right to access, correct, update or object to the use of your Personal Information by making a written request to StockNow by using our Contact Us page. Your requests will be dealt with in a prompt and professional manner and in accordance with applicable law.\",\"Transfer Of Your Personal Information To Other Countries\":\"Transfer Of Your Personal Information To Other Countries\",\"Some of the uses and disclosures mentioned in this Privacy Policy may involve the transfer and processing of your personal information to and in various countries that may have different levels of privacy protection than your country. By using our products and services, you consent to such transfers and processing, including to and in Bangladesh.\":\"Some of the uses and disclosures mentioned in this Privacy Policy may involve the transfer and processing of your personal information to and in various countries that may have different levels of privacy protection than your country. By using our products and services, you consent to such transfers and processing, including to and in Bangladesh.\",\"Links To Third-Party Websites\":\"Links To Third-Party Websites\",\"StockNow may provide links to third-party websites, including social networking websites. Since we do not control third-party sites and are not responsible for any information you may provide while on such sites, we encourage you to read the privacy policies on those websites before providing any of your information on such sites.\":\"StockNow may provide links to third-party websites, including social networking websites. Since we do not control third-party sites and are not responsible for any information you may provide while on such sites, we encourage you to read the privacy policies on those websites before providing any of your information on such sites.\",\"Questions Regarding This Privacy Policy\":\"Questions Regarding This Privacy Policy\",\"If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at support@stocknow.com.bd. Please include \u201cPrivacy\u201d in the Subject line of your inquiry. If you have complaints about StockNow\u2019s processing of your personal information, you may have the right to contact the applicable supervisory authority.\":\"If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at support@stocknow.com.bd. Please include \u201cPrivacy\u201d in the Subject line of your inquiry. If you have complaints about StockNow\u2019s processing of your personal information, you may have the right to contact the applicable supervisory authority.\",\"Modifications To This Privacy Policy\":\"Modifications To This Privacy Policy\",\"StockNow reserves the right to change this Privacy Policy at any time by posting revisions on this Web page. Such changes will be effective upon posting.\":\"StockNow reserves the right to change this Privacy Policy at any time by posting revisions on this Web page. Such changes will be effective upon posting.\",\"Last modified: December 16, 2020\":\"Last modified: December 16, 2020\",\"DIGITAL PRODUCTS REFUND POLICY\":\"DIGITAL PRODUCTS REFUND POLICY\",\"PURCHASE TERMS OF AGREEMENT\":\"PURCHASE TERMS OF AGREEMENT\",\"The purchase of digital products, including subscription and online material is subject to the following terms and conditions. Consumers are advised to review carefully before making any purchase.\":\"The purchase of digital products, including subscription and online material is subject to the following terms and conditions. Consumers are advised to review carefully before making any purchase.\",\"PAYMENT + REFUND POLICY\":\"PAYMENT + REFUND POLICY\",\"All transactions for purchase of intangible products, online course subscription, resource material, and online content are made through payment gateways that use SSL encryption. These payment gateways are safe and secure for using all types of credit cards and debit cards in different countries and your details are not stored during this process.\":\"All transactions for purchase of intangible products, online course subscription, resource material, and online content are made through payment gateways that use SSL encryption. These payment gateways are safe and secure for using all types of credit cards and debit cards in different countries and your details are not stored during this process.\",\"Since your purchase is a digital product, it is deemed \u201cused\u201d after download or opening, and all purchases made on stocknow.com.bd are non-refundable or exchangeable. Since the products made available here are intangible, there is a strict no refund policy. However, if you believe that you have been charged in error or if you believe you should be refunded for any other reason, you should contact us (support@stocknow.com.bd) within 7 days of such charge. For card and others payment methods it will take up to 10 working days to process the refund.\":\"Since your purchase is a digital product, it is deemed \u201cused\u201d after download or opening, and all purchases made on stocknow.com.bd are non-refundable or exchangeable. Since the products made available here are intangible, there is a strict no refund policy. However, if you believe that you have been charged in error or if you believe you should be refunded for any other reason, you should contact us (support@stocknow.com.bd) within 7 days of such charge. For card and others payment methods it will take up to 10 working days to process the refund.\",\"StockNow reserves the right to amend any information, including but not limited to prices, technical specifications, terms of purchase and product or service offerings without prior notice.\":\"StockNow reserves the right to amend any information, including but not limited to prices, technical specifications, terms of purchase and product or service offerings without prior notice.\",\"NAV\":\"NAV\",\"EPS\":\"EPS\",\"YEND\":\"YEND\",\"GP\":\"GP\",\"Jun\":\"Jun\",\"Terms And Conditions\":\"Terms And Conditions\",\"The following describes the terms and conditions (the \u201c Terms and Conditions \u201d) upon which StockNow (the \u201c Company \u201d or \u201c StockNow \u201d or \u201c We \u201d) offers access to the Internet site found at www.Stocknow.com.bd alongside its related country specific sites and any related sub-domains and/or mobile applications thereof (respectively, the \u201c Site \u201d or \u201c App \u201d, and together the \u201c Services \u201d) to you the customer, irrespective of whether or not you are an Account (as defined below) holder (\u201c you \u201d or \u201c You \u201d)\u201c\u201d.\":\"The following describes the terms and conditions (the \u201c Terms and Conditions \u201d) upon which StockNow (the \u201c Company \u201d or \u201c StockNow \u201d or \u201c We \u201d) offers access to the Internet site found at www.Stocknow.com.bd alongside its related country specific sites and any related sub-domains and/or mobile applications thereof (respectively, the \u201c Site \u201d or \u201c App \u201d, and together the \u201c Services \u201d) to you the customer, irrespective of whether or not you are an Account (as defined below) holder (\u201c you \u201d or \u201c You \u201d)\u201c\u201d.\",\"PLEASE READ THE FOLLOWING TERMS AND CONDITIONS BEFORE USING OUR SERVICES. BY CONTINUING TO ACCESS OR USE OUR SERVICES, YOU SIGNIFY YOUR ACCEPTANCE OF THESE TERMS AND CONDITIONS. We reserve the right to amend, remove, or add to these Terms and Conditions at any time. Please check the \u201cLast modified\u201d heading at the top of this document to see when the Terms and Conditions were last updated. Any changes to the Terms and Conditions will become effective when we post the revised Terms and Conditions. Your use of the Services, or your provision of personal information following any changes means that you accept the updated Terms and Conditions.\":\"PLEASE READ THE FOLLOWING TERMS AND CONDITIONS BEFORE USING OUR SERVICES. BY CONTINUING TO ACCESS OR USE OUR SERVICES, YOU SIGNIFY YOUR ACCEPTANCE OF THESE TERMS AND CONDITIONS. We reserve the right to amend, remove, or add to these Terms and Conditions at any time. Please check the \u201cLast modified\u201d heading at the top of this document to see when the Terms and Conditions were last updated. Any changes to the Terms and Conditions will become effective when we post the revised Terms and Conditions. Your use of the Services, or your provision of personal information following any changes means that you accept the updated Terms and Conditions.\",\"If, at any time, you do not wish to accept the Terms and Conditions, you may not use our Services. Any terms and conditions proposed by you which are in addition to, or which conflict with these Terms and Conditions are expressly rejected by the Company and will have no force or effect.\":\"If, at any time, you do not wish to accept the Terms and Conditions, you may not use our Services. Any terms and conditions proposed by you which are in addition to, or which conflict with these Terms and Conditions are expressly rejected by the Company and will have no force or effect.\",\"You understand and agree that StockNow may discontinue or change the Services at any time, without notice. You also understand and agree that StockNow may discontinue or restrict your use of the Services for any reason without notice.\":\"You understand and agree that StockNow may discontinue or change the Services at any time, without notice. You also understand and agree that StockNow may discontinue or restrict your use of the Services for any reason without notice.\",\"Your Account\":\"Your Account\",\"As part of the process necessary to set up an account on the Services (an \u201c Account \u201d) and obtain access to certain parts of the Services, you will be required to either provide your full name, email address, password, and phone number (the \u201c Registration Credentials \u201d). You must ensure that your Registration Credentials are accurate, truthful and updated. We reserve the right to block the creation of your Account based on our inability to confirm the authenticity of your Registration Credentials.\":\"As part of the process necessary to set up an account on the Services (an \u201c Account \u201d) and obtain access to certain parts of the Services, you will be required to either provide your full name, email address, password, and phone number (the \u201c Registration Credentials \u201d). You must ensure that your Registration Credentials are accurate, truthful and updated. We reserve the right to block the creation of your Account based on our inability to confirm the authenticity of your Registration Credentials.\",\"We permit you to maintain only one Account to access the Services at any time and you hereby represent that you currently have no other Account(s).\":\"We permit you to maintain only one Account to access the Services at any time and you hereby represent that you currently have no other Account(s).\",\"We reserve the right to terminate your Account, in our sole discretion, at any time without notice. You may terminate your Account at any time by contact through \u201cinfo@stocknow.com.bd\u201d. Upon termination, you will receive an automated confirmation via e-mail that the request was received, and your Account will be terminated immediately.\":\"We reserve the right to terminate your Account, in our sole discretion, at any time without notice. You may terminate your Account at any time by contact through \u201cinfo@stocknow.com.bd\u201d. Upon termination, you will receive an automated confirmation via e-mail that the request was received, and your Account will be terminated immediately.\",\"VIP-Membership Services\":\"VIP-Membership Services\",\"Our basic Services are free, but we may offer You paid upgrades for the \u201cVIP-Membership\u201d version of the Services (\u201c VIP-Membership Services \u201d).\":\"Our basic Services are free, but we may offer You paid upgrades for the \u201cVIP-Membership\u201d version of the Services (\u201c VIP-Membership Services \u201d).\",\"You may purchase VIP-Membership Services, which include, subject to a specific policy/ies of an various app stores (such as Google Play or Apple App Store(, and applicable law, a removal of all the ads on Your Account in all related online platforms, including from our Site and our App, which are available for use in such app stores. These VIP-Membership Services will be available to You only when You are signed-in to our Services.\":\"You may purchase VIP-Membership Services, which include, subject to a specific policy/ies of an various app stores (such as Google Play or Apple App Store(, and applicable law, a removal of all the ads on Your Account in all related online platforms, including from our Site and our App, which are available for use in such app stores. These VIP-Membership Services will be available to You only when You are signed-in to our Services.\",\"Other VIP-Membership Services are governed by any additional terms you agree to when you register for the VIP-Membership Services (including any third party\u2019s terms of service, privacy policy and other relevant policies providing any such Subscription Based Service, which you should read thoroughly before agreeing to them) and these Terms. If you register for VIP-Membership Services, you agree to pay the applicable Subscription Fees set forth on the Site and/or App and must designate a payment method and provide us with accurate billing and payment information, and you have the continuing obligation to keep it up to date. If the VIP-Membership Services includes a third-party product or service, you understand and agree that your purchase and use of the Service is also subject to the third party\u2019s terms of service and privacy policy, which you should read thoroughly before agreeing to them. StockNow assume no liability or responsibility on such products or services when it is provided by a third party.\":\"Other VIP-Membership Services are governed by any additional terms you agree to when you register for the VIP-Membership Services (including any third party\u2019s terms of service, privacy policy and other relevant policies providing any such Subscription Based Service, which you should read thoroughly before agreeing to them) and these Terms. If you register for VIP-Membership Services, you agree to pay the applicable Subscription Fees set forth on the Site and/or App and must designate a payment method and provide us with accurate billing and payment information, and you have the continuing obligation to keep it up to date. If the VIP-Membership Services includes a third-party product or service, you understand and agree that your purchase and use of the Service is also subject to the third party\u2019s terms of service and privacy policy, which you should read thoroughly before agreeing to them. StockNow assume no liability or responsibility on such products or services when it is provided by a third party.\",\"Payment. In order to purchase VIP-Membership Services, You will be required to make the payments specified in the VIP-Membership Services dedicated offering page, using a payment method made available to You. You represent that you are at least the minimum age required to enter into a legal agreement. You may be required to share Your information (such as your name, registered mobile number, Transaction number, Serial Number etc.) and any other information which is required by the payment service providers in order to complete the purchase of the VIP-Membership Services. We may change the rates of the VIP-Membership Services from time to time and at our sole discretion.\":\"Payment. In order to purchase VIP-Membership Services, You will be required to make the payments specified in the VIP-Membership Services dedicated offering page, using a payment method made available to You. You represent that you are at least the minimum age required to enter into a legal agreement. You may be required to share Your information (such as your name, registered mobile number, Transaction number, Serial Number etc.) and any other information which is required by the payment service providers in order to complete the purchase of the VIP-Membership Services. We may change the rates of the VIP-Membership Services from time to time and at our sole discretion.\",\"No Refunds . Notwithstanding anything to the contrary set forth herein (but subject to any applicable law), all charges for a VIP-Membership Services are nonrefundable unless provided otherwise in the terms you agree to when you register for a VIP-Membership Services. However, if you believe that you have been charged in error or if you believe you should be refunded for any other reason, you should contact us within 7 days of such charge.\":\"No Refunds . Notwithstanding anything to the contrary set forth herein (but subject to any applicable law), all charges for a VIP-Membership Services are nonrefundable unless provided otherwise in the terms you agree to when you register for a VIP-Membership Services. However, if you believe that you have been charged in error or if you believe you should be refunded for any other reason, you should contact us within 7 days of such charge.\",\"The refund process may take up to 10 working days or more depending upon the payment service gateway provider\u2019s clauses. The refund will be initiated within the same payment channel i.e. if the customer pays via bKash then the customer will be refunded through bKash. The customer cannot be refunded via any other payment channels. But StockNow retains the right and has the right to consider/reconsider refund via another flexible channel(s) to make the refund system faster or to make it easier for the customer.\":\"The refund process may take up to 10 working days or more depending upon the payment service gateway provider\u2019s clauses. The refund will be initiated within the same payment channel i.e. if the customer pays via bKash then the customer will be refunded through bKash. The customer cannot be refunded via any other payment channels. But StockNow retains the right and has the right to consider/reconsider refund via another flexible channel(s) to make the refund system faster or to make it easier for the customer.\",\"The customer will not be eligible for any extra cashback/bonus against his principal amount in case of refunds. StockNow is not bound to pay any kind of service charge or cost for the refunded amount.\":\"The customer will not be eligible for any extra cashback/bonus against his principal amount in case of refunds. StockNow is not bound to pay any kind of service charge or cost for the refunded amount.\",\"We reserve the right to refuse such a refund request for any reason, including if we reasonably believe (i) that you are trying to unfairly exploit this refund policy, for example, by making repetitive refund requests in respect of the same feature; (ii) if you are in breach of the Terms; or (iii) if we reasonably suspect that you are using the VIP-Membership Services fraudulently.\":\"We reserve the right to refuse such a refund request for any reason, including if we reasonably believe (i) that you are trying to unfairly exploit this refund policy, for example, by making repetitive refund requests in respect of the same feature; (ii) if you are in breach of the Terms; or (iii) if we reasonably suspect that you are using the VIP-Membership Services fraudulently.\",\"Notice Period . You must notify us about any payment problems or discrepancies within 90 days after they first appear on your payment method statement. If you do not bring them to our attention within 90 days, you agree that you waive your right to dispute such problems or discrepancies.\":\"Notice Period . You must notify us about any payment problems or discrepancies within 90 days after they first appear on your payment method statement. If you do not br