 with breaking news, corporate disclosures, market trends, and essential updates directly impacting share prices and investor decisions in Bangladesh. Access timely and accurate information for better stock trading strategies.\":\"Get the latest news and official announcements for stocks listed on the Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) and Chittagong Stock Exchange (CSE). Stay informed with breaking news, corporate disclosures, market trends, and essential updates directly impacting share prices and investor decisions in Bangladesh. Access timely and accurate information for better stock trading strategies.\",\"Data Matrix \u2013 Comprehensive Stock Analysis and Performance Metrics | StockNow\":\"Data Matrix \u2013 Comprehensive Stock Analysis and Performance Metrics | StockNow\",\"Dive deep into stock analysis with StockNow\\'s Data Matrix. Access detailed performance metrics, historical data, and trend analysis for DSE and CSE stocks. Make informed decisions with our comprehensive tools tailored for both seasoned investors and beginners in Bangladesh\u2019s stock market. Enhance your investment strategy with insights on stock performance, earnings, and more.\":\"Dive deep into stock analysis with StockNow\\'s Data Matrix. Access detailed performance metrics, historical data, and trend analysis for DSE and CSE stocks. Make informed decisions with our comprehensive tools tailored for both seasoned investors and beginners in Bangladesh\u2019s stock market. Enhance your investment strategy with insights on stock performance, earnings, and more.\",\"Upper Limit\":\"Upper Limit\",\"Lower Limit\":\"Lower Limit\",\"Open lesson {title}\":\"Open lesson {title}\",\"Open submitted screenshot {number}\":\"Open submitted screenshot {number}\",\"Submitted screenshot {number}\":\"Submitted screenshot {number}\",\"Screenshot preview {number}\":\"Screenshot preview {number}\",\"Remove screenshot {number}\":\"Remove screenshot {number}\",\"Browser notifications\":\"Browser notifications\",\"Log in to receive notifications in this browser.\":\"Log in to receive notifications in this browser.\",\"Browser notifications require a secure HTTPS connection.\":\"Browser notifications require a secure HTTPS connection.\",\"Checking browser notification support...\":\"Checking browser notification support...\",\"Notifications are unavailable in this browser. Try a supported browser. On iPhone or iPad, add StockNow to your Home Screen and open it there.\":\"Notifications are unavailable in this browser. Try a supported browser. On iPhone or iPad, add StockNow to your Home Screen and open it there.\",\"Notifications are blocked. Allow notifications for StockNow in your browser settings, then check again.\":\"Notifications are blocked. Allow notifications for StockNow in your browser settings, then check again.\",\"Notifications are enabled for this browser.\":\"Notifications are enabled for this browser.\",\"Receive StockNow alerts even when this page is closed.\":\"Receive StockNow alerts even when this page is closed.\",\"Turn off for this browser\":\"Turn off for this browser\",\"Enable notifications\":\"Enable notifications\",\"Could not enable browser notifications. Please try again.\":\"Could not enable browser notifications. Please try again.\",\"Could not disable browser notifications. Please try again.\":\"Could not disable browser notifications. Please try again.\",\"Reload page\":\"Reload page\",\"Your account changed in another tab. Reload this page to manage notifications.\":\"Your account changed in another tab. Reload this page to manage notifications.\",\"Market overview\":\"Market overview\",\"Share prices, organized by sector.\":\"Share prices, organized by sector.\",\"Latest available prices\":\"Latest available prices\",\"Market breadth\":\"Market breadth\",\"Filter prices\":\"Filter prices\",\"Search by symbol, company or sector\":\"Search by symbol, company or sector\",\"Clear search\":\"Clear search\",\"All sectors\":\"All sectors\",\"Other sectors\":\"Other sectors\",\"Sort within sectors\":\"Sort within sectors\",\"Symbol A\u2013Z\":\"Symbol A\u2013Z\",\"Change: high to low\":\"Change: high to low\",\"Change: low to high\":\"Change: low to high\",\"Price: high to low\":\"Price: high to low\",\"Change (%)\":\"Change (%)\",\"Showing {shown} of {total} shares in {count} sectors\":\"Showing {shown} of {total} shares in {count} sectors\",\"Reset filters\":\"Reset filters\",\"{count} shares\":\"{count} shares\",\"Share prices for {sector}\":\"Share prices for {sector}\",\"No trading data for the latest session\":\"No trading data for the latest session\",\"Change unavailable\":\"Change unavailable\",\"No matching shares\":\"No matching shares\",\"No prices available\":\"No prices available\",\"Try another symbol or company, or reset your filters.\":\"Try another symbol or company, or reset your filters.\",\"Prices will appear here when market data is available.\":\"Prices will appear here when market data is available.\",\"Prices in BDT. Change is relative to the previous close.\":\"Prices in BDT. Change is relative to the previous close.\",\"A dash means price or session change is unavailable.\":\"A dash means price or session change is unavailable.\",\"{time} (Dhaka)\":\"{time} (Dhaka)\",\"All shares\":\"All shares\",\"Gainers\":\"Gainers\",\"Losers\":\"Losers\",\"No session data\":\"No session data\",\"EOD Downloads\":\"EOD Downloads\",\"Download daily open, high, low, close and volume data for AmiBroker or other software that supports CSV and text imports.\":\"Download daily open, high, low, close and volume data for AmiBroker or other software that supports CSV and text imports.\",\"Export settings\":\"Export settings\",\"Choose your data\":\"Choose your data\",\"Software / file format\":\"Software / file format\",\"From date\":\"From date\",\"To date\":\"To date\",\"Date shortcuts\":\"Date shortcuts\",\"1 month\":\"1 month\",\"3 months\":\"3 months\",\"1 year\":\"1 year\",\"Only dates before today in Bangladesh are included, so an unfinished trading day is never exported as EOD. Holidays have no rows.\":\"Only dates before today in Bangladesh are included, so an unfinished trading day is never exported as EOD. Holidays have no rows.\",\"Symbols to export\":\"Symbols to export\",\"All shares ({count})\":\"All shares ({count})\",\"Choose symbols\":\"Choose symbols\",\"Search by symbol or company\":\"Search by symbol or company\",\"{count} selected\":\"{count} selected\",\"Select matching\":\"Select matching\",\"Clear selection\":\"Clear selection\",\"Price history\":\"Price history\",\"Unadjusted prices\":\"Unadjusted prices\",\"Adjusted prices\":\"Adjusted prices\",\"Use the same price type for every import into your database.\":\"Use the same price type for every import into your database.\",\"Download progress\":\"Download progress\",\"Preparing\u2026\":\"Preparing\u2026\",\"Import into your software\":\"Import into your software\",\"In AmiBroker, open or create a database with the base time interval set to End-of-Day.\":\"In AmiBroker, open or create a database with the base time interval set to End-of-Day.\",\"Choose File \u2192 Import Wizard and select your downloaded CSV file.\":\"Choose File \u2192 Import Wizard and select your downloaded CSV file.\",\"Use a comma separator, skip the first line, and map the columns in the order shown below. Set the date field to YMD.\":\"Use a comma separator, skip the first line, and map the columns in the order shown below. Set the date field to YMD.\",\"Enable automatic creation of new symbols, then finish the import. Save these settings for future downloads.\":\"Enable automatic creation of new symbols, then finish the import. Save these settings for future downloads.\",\"AmiBroker import guide\":\"AmiBroker import guide\",\"Download AmiBroker .format file\":\"Download AmiBroker .format file\",\"Optional: use this definition when configuring an AmiBroker ASCII import format. The Import Wizard works without it.\":\"Optional: use this definition when configuring an AmiBroker ASCII import format. The Import Wizard works without it.\",\"Open the CSV or ASCII import tool in your software and map the columns below. The first line contains column names; skip it when importing.\":\"Open the CSV or ASCII import tool in your software and map the columns below. The first line contains column names; skip it when importing.\",\"Choose a tab separator.\":\"Choose a tab separator.\",\"Choose a comma separator.\":\"Choose a comma separator.\",\"Use the MetaStock Downloader ASCII conversion tool. Dates use YYYYMMDD and the period is D (daily).\":\"Use the MetaStock Downloader ASCII conversion tool. Dates use YYYYMMDD and the period is D (daily).\",\"Dates use YYYY-MM-DD. Choose a daily or End-of-Day interval.\":\"Dates use YYYY-MM-DD. Choose a daily or End-of-Day interval.\",\"Column order\":\"Column order\",\"Prices are in BDT and volume is in shares. Files use English numbers without thousands separators.\":\"Prices are in BDT and volume is in shares. Files use English numbers without thousands separators.\",\"For other broker software, choose CSV or tab-separated text and match its import settings. Compatibility depends on the formats your software accepts.\":\"For other broker software, choose CSV or tab-separated text and match its import settings. Compatibility depends on the formats your software accepts.\",\"Your file is ready\":\"Your file is ready\",\"No EOD data found\":\"No EOD data found\",\"{rows} daily records across {symbols} symbols.\":\"{rows} daily records across {symbols} symbols.\",\"Try a wider date range or different symbols. Non-trading days do not have EOD records.\":\"Try a wider date range or different symbols. Non-trading days do not have EOD records.\",\"Some symbols could not be loaded. This download is incomplete.\":\"Some symbols could not be loaded. This download is incomplete.\",\"{count} symbols have no data in this range\":\"{count} symbols have no data in this range\",\"Download file\":\"Download file\",\"Preview first {count} records\":\"Preview first {count} records\",\"Download daily price and volume data for AmiBroker, MetaStock, or CSV-compatible software.\":\"Download daily price and volume data for AmiBroker, MetaStock, or CSV-compatible software.\",\"Download EOD data\":\"Download EOD data\",\"AmiBroker\":\"AmiBroker\",\"CSV for AmiBroker with dates in YYYYMMDD format.\":\"CSV for AmiBroker with dates in YYYYMMDD format.\",\"MetaStock ASCII\":\"MetaStock ASCII\",\"Daily ASCII data for conversion with MetaStock The DownLoader.\":\"Daily ASCII data for conversion with MetaStock The DownLoader.\",\"Universal CSV\":\"Universal CSV\",\"Comma-separated data with dates in YYYY-MM-DD format.\":\"Comma-separated data with dates in YYYY-MM-DD format.\",\"Universal TSV\":\"Universal TSV\",\"Tab-separated data with dates in YYYY-MM-DD format.\":\"Tab-separated data with dates in YYYY-MM-DD format.\",\"Choose a valid date range ending before today in Bangladesh.\":\"Choose a valid date range ending before today in Bangladesh.\",\"Select at least one symbol to download.\":\"Select at least one symbol to download.\",\"Could not prepare your download. Please try again.\":\"Could not prepare your download. Please try again.\",\"In MetaStock The DownLoader, convert the downloaded file using ASCII Text as the source type. Keep the header line so the columns can be recognized.\":\"In MetaStock The DownLoader, convert the downloaded file using ASCII Text as the source type. Keep the header line so the columns can be recognized.\",\"Could not load EOD data\":\"Could not load EOD data\",\"Preparing EOD data\u2026\":\"Preparing EOD data\u2026\",\"This export is too large. Choose fewer symbols or a shorter date range.\":\"This export is too large. Choose fewer symbols or a shorter date range.\",\"This export exceeds {count} records. Choose fewer symbols or a shorter date range.\":\"This export exceeds {count} records. Choose fewer symbols or a shorter date range.\",\"Download period\":\"Download period\",\"Custom date range\":\"Custom date range\",\"Single day\":\"Single day\",\"Trading date\":\"Trading date\",\"New data since my last download\":\"New data since my last download\",\"Last date already in your software\":\"Last date already in your software\",\"Last download on this browser included data through {date}. You can change the date above.\":\"Last download on this browser included data through {date}. You can change the date above.\",\"Enter the last date you already imported. Your download will include only later dates.\":\"Enter the last date you already imported. Your download will include only later dates.\",\"No new completed trading day is available yet.\":\"No new completed trading day is available yet.\",\"Download new data from {from} through {to}.\":\"Download new data from {from} through {to}.\",\"Downloading\u2026\":\"Downloading\u2026\",\"Adding the next day\":\"Adding the next day\",\"Choose new data since your last download, then import the downloaded file into the same database. Missed days are included automatically.\":\"Choose new data since your last download, then import the downloaded file into the same database. Missed days are included automatically.\",\"Your last download is remembered in this browser. If a file was not saved or imported, change the last date to download those days again.\":\"Your last download is remembered in this browser. If a file was not saved or imported, change the last date to download those days again.\",\"Download started\":\"Download started\",\"Only available data was included. Your last download date has not advanced; retry to get the missing symbols.\":\"Only available data was included. Your last download date has not advanced; retry to get the missing symbols.\",\"Download again\":\"Download again\",\"Enter the last date already in your software.\":\"Enter the last date already in your software.\",\"For adjusted prices, download the full range again after a split or dividend adjustment.\":\"For adjusted prices, download the full range again after a split or dividend adjustment.\"}'),y=JSON.parse('{\"Block Transactions on:\":\"\u09ac\u09cd\u09b2\u0995 \u09b2\u09c7\u09a8\u09a6\u09c7\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a4\u09be\u09b0\u09bf\u0996:\",\"Latest Share Price and Updates\":\"\u09b6\u09c7\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09b0\u09cd\u09ac\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7 \u09a6\u09be\u09ae \u0993 \u0986\u09aa\u09a1\u09c7\u099f\",\"Index Mover (Positive)\":\"\u09b8\u09c2\u099a\u0995\u09c7 \u0987\u09a4\u09bf\u09ac\u09be\u099a\u0995 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\",\"Symbol\":\"\u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09c0\u0995\",\"Price\":\"\u09a6\u09be\u09ae\",\"CHNG(%)\":\"\u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09a8 (%)\",\"INDX CHNG\":\"\u09b8\u09c2\u099a\u0995\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09a8\",\"Index Mover (Negative)\":\"\u09b8\u09c2\u099a\u0995\u09c7 \u09a8\u09c7\u09a4\u09bf\u09ac\u09be\u099a\u0995 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\",\"Back\":\"\u09ab\u09bf\u09b0\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u09a8\",\"Course\":\"\u0995\u09cb\u09b0\u09cd\u09b8\",\"{value} lessons \u2022 {value2}\":\"{value}\u099f\u09bf \u09aa\u09be\u09a0 \u2022 {value2}\",\"This is a paid lesson. Watch the preview or buy the course to continue.\":\"\u098f\u0987 \u09aa\u09be\u09a0\u099f\u09bf \u09a6\u09c7\u0996\u09a4\u09c7 \u0985\u09b0\u09cd\u09a5\u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a6\u09be\u09a8 \u0995\u09b0\u09a4\u09c7 \u09b9\u09ac\u09c7\u0964 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09ad\u09bf\u0989 \u09a6\u09c7\u0996\u09c1\u09a8 \u0985\u09a5\u09ac\u09be \u099a\u09be\u09b2\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u09af\u09c7\u09a4\u09c7 \u0995\u09cb\u09b0\u09cd\u09b8\u099f\u09bf \u0995\u09bf\u09a8\u09c1\u09a8\u0964\",\"Buy course\":\"\u0995\u09cb\u09b0\u09cd\u09b8 \u0995\u09bf\u09a8\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Mark as completed\":\"\u09b8\u09ae\u09cd\u09aa\u09a8\u09cd\u09a8 \u09b9\u09bf\u09b8\u09c7\u09ac\u09c7 \u099a\u09bf\u09b9\u09cd\u09a8\u09bf\u09a4 \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Lessons\":\"\u09aa\u09be\u09a0\u09b8\u09ae\u09c2\u09b9\",\"{value} / {value2} completed \u2022 {value3} lessons \u2022 {value4}\":\"{value} / {value2} \u09b8\u09ae\u09cd\u09aa\u09a8\u09cd\u09a8 \u2022 {value3}\u099f\u09bf \u09aa\u09be\u09a0 \u2022 {value4}\",\"Module {value} \u2014 {value2}\":\"\u09ae\u09a1\u09bf\u0989\u09b2 {value} \u2014 {value2}\",\"{value} lesson(s)\":\"{value}\u099f\u09bf \u09aa\u09be\u09a0\",\"thumbnail\":\"\u09a5\u09be\u09ae\u09cd\u09ac\u09a8\u09c7\u0987\u09b2\",\"Save Screener\":\"\u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09a8\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u0982\u09b0\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09a3 \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Name this strategy so you can run it again later.\":\"\u098f\u0987 \u0995\u09cc\u09b6\u09b2\u099f\u09bf\u09b0 \u098f\u0995\u099f\u09bf \u09a8\u09be\u09ae \u09a6\u09bf\u09a8, \u09af\u09c7\u09a8 \u09aa\u09b0\u09c7 \u0986\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u09ac\u09b9\u09be\u09b0 \u0995\u09b0\u09a4\u09c7 \u09aa\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8\u0964\",\"Name\":\"\u09a8\u09be\u09ae\",\"Enter screener name\":\"\u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09a8\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a8\u09be\u09ae \u09b2\u09bf\u0996\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Cancel\":\"\u09ac\u09be\u09a4\u09bf\u09b2\",\"Save\":\"\u09b8\u0982\u09b0\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09a3 \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Change Compare With\":\"\u09a4\u09c1\u09b2\u09a8\u09be\u09b0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b7\u09af\u09bc \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09a8 \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Add Filter\":\"\u09ab\u09bf\u09b2\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0 \u09af\u09cb\u0997 \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Search filter, indicator, ratio\":\"\u09ab\u09bf\u09b2\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0, \u09a8\u09bf\u09b0\u09cd\u09a6\u09c7\u09b6\u0995 \u09ac\u09be \u0985\u09a8\u09c1\u09aa\u09be\u09a4 \u0996\u09c1\u0981\u099c\u09c1\u09a8\",\"No filter found.\":\"\u0995\u09cb\u09a8\u09cb \u09ab\u09bf\u09b2\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0 \u09aa\u09be\u0993\u09af\u09bc\u09be \u09af\u09be\u09af\u09bc\u09a8\u09bf\u0964\",\"Try another keyword.\":\"\u0985\u09a8\u09cd\u09af \u09b6\u09ac\u09cd\u09a6 \u09a6\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u0996\u09c1\u0981\u099c\u09c1\u09a8\u0964\",\"Screener Builder\":\"\u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09a8\u09be\u09b0 \u09a4\u09c8\u09b0\u09bf \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Edit your screener\":\"\u0986\u09aa\u09a8\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09a8\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09cd\u09aa\u09be\u09a6\u09a8\u09be \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Create custom screener\":\"\u09a8\u09bf\u099c\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09a8\u09be\u09b0 \u09a4\u09c8\u09b0\u09bf \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Combine market, technical, and fundamental filters into one reusable strategy.\":\"\u09ac\u09be\u099c\u09be\u09b0, \u099f\u09c7\u0995\u09a8\u09bf\u0995\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09b2 \u0993 \u09ab\u09be\u09a8\u09cd\u09a1\u09be\u09ae\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b2 \u09ab\u09bf\u09b2\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0 \u09ae\u09bf\u09b2\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u09ac\u09be\u09b0\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u09ac\u09b9\u09be\u09b0\u09af\u09cb\u0997\u09cd\u09af \u098f\u0995\u099f\u09bf \u0995\u09cc\u09b6\u09b2 \u09a4\u09c8\u09b0\u09bf \u0995\u09b0\u09c1\u09a8\u0964\",\"Filter\":\"\u09ab\u09bf\u09b2\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0\",\"Filters\":\"\u09ab\u09bf\u09b2\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0\u09b8\u09ae\u09c2\u09b9\",\"Enter name\":\"\u09a8\u09be\u09ae \u09b2\u09bf\u0996\u09c1\u09a8\",\"Conditions\":\"\u09b6\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09b8\u09ae\u09c2\u09b9\",\"Regular candles\":\"\u09b8\u09be\u09a7\u09be\u09b0\u09a3 \u0995\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09a8\u09cd\u09a1\u09c7\u09b2\",\"Heikin Ashi {value}\":\"\u09b9\u09c7\u0987\u0995\u09bf\u09a8 \u0986\u09b6\u09bf {value}\",\"Both sides use Heikin Ashi prices for this condition. Volume is unchanged.\":\"\u098f\u0987 \u09b6\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u0989\u09ad\u09af\u09bc \u09aa\u09be\u09b6\u09c7 \u09b9\u09c7\u0987\u0995\u09bf\u09a8 \u0986\u09b6\u09bf\u09b0 \u09a6\u09be\u09ae \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u09ac\u09b9\u09be\u09b0 \u0995\u09b0\u09be \u09b9\u09ac\u09c7