 analysis of the Dhaka Stock Exchange. As the leading financial markets app in Bangladesh, we offer comprehensive stock market information through our website, Android, and iPhone platforms, ensuring you stay informed and empowered, wherever you are.\":\"Welcome to StockNow, the premier platform for real-time financial data, charts, and in-depth analysis of the Dhaka Stock Exchange. As the leading financial markets app in Bangladesh, we offer comprehensive stock market information through our website, Android, and iPhone platforms, ensuring you stay informed and empowered, wherever you are.\",\"StockNow was founded by Aminul Islam Selim, well-known as Selim Aminul, a visionary in financial technology with a passion for democratizing access to stock market information. Selim Aminul\\'s expertise and commitment to innovation drive our platform\u2019s success and continuous evolution.\":\"StockNow was founded by Aminul Islam Selim, well-known as Selim Aminul, a visionary in financial technology with a passion for democratizing access to stock market information. Selim Aminul\\'s expertise and commitment to innovation drive our platform\u2019s success and continuous evolution.\",\"Our Mission\":\"Our Mission\",\"At StockNow, our mission is to provide investors with cutting-edge tools and insights to make smart financial decisions. We combine the latest news, real-time data, and expert analysis into a user-friendly platform designed to meet the needs of both seasoned investors and those just starting out.\":\"At StockNow, our mission is to provide investors with cutting-edge tools and insights to make smart financial decisions. We combine the latest news, real-time data, and expert analysis into a user-friendly platform designed to meet the needs of both seasoned investors and those just starting out.\",\"Our team is dedicated to delivering the best possible experience for our users, and we\\'re constantly working to improve our app and add new features to help you stay ahead of the curve. We believe that everyone deserves access to the tools and resources they need to make smart financial decisions, and we\\'re committed to delivering a comprehensive, user-friendly solution for our users.\":\"Our team is dedicated to delivering the best possible experience for our users, and we\\'re constantly working to improve our app and add new features to help you stay ahead of the curve. We believe that everyone deserves access to the tools and resources they need to make smart financial decisions, and we\\'re committed to delivering a comprehensive, user-friendly solution for our users.\",\"With StockNow, you can easily analyze and understand the stock market and make informed investment decisions promptly. Thank you for choosing StockNow, and we look forward to helping you achieve your investment goals!\":\"With StockNow, you can easily analyze and understand the stock market and make informed investment decisions promptly. Thank you for choosing StockNow, and we look forward to helping you achieve your investment goals!\",\"StockNow\\'s main objective is to gain awareness among investors in Bangladesh.\":\"StockNow\\'s main objective is to gain awareness among investors in Bangladesh.\",\"StockNow uses charts powered by TradingView. A trading and investing platform providing cutting edge analytical tools like\":\"StockNow uses charts powered by TradingView. A trading and investing platform providing cutting edge analytical tools like\",\"Screener\":\"Screener\",\"and\":\"and\",\"Economic Calendar\":\"Economic Calendar\",\"StockNow offers two types of services; Basic free services and VIP-Membership services.\":\"StockNow offers two types of services; Basic free services and VIP-Membership services.\",\"Basic free services:\":\"Basic free services:\",\"Share price\":\"Share price\",\"Trade information\":\"Trade information\",\"Fundamental information\":\"Fundamental information\",\"Manage Portfolio\":\"Manage Portfolio\",\"Minute Chart, 1 